    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36667" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pleurītis</span></b> ,
		ĭdis, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλευρῖ?τις</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A sharp pain in the side</i>, <i>pleurisy</i> (pure Lat. dolor lateris): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arthritis, tussis, pleuritis, phthisis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 1,
					6</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The register</i> in a hydraulic organ, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 10,
			13</span></i> dub. (al. plinthis).</div>
